package api

var sswCurriculumFisheryBodies4English = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Perubahan suhu atau salinitas yang mendadak dapat menyebabkan stres. Penerimaan organisme dari lokasi lain memerlukan prosedur aklimatisasi menurut spesies, ukuran, serta sistem pengangkutan. Jangan menuangkan semua air angkut ke unit budidaya tanpa prosedur biosekuriti. Periksa kondisi wadah, waktu kedatangan, data lingkungan, dan status kelompok. Bila ada kematian atau gangguan, hentikan pemindahan yang tidak aman dan minta arahan. Proses adaptasi tidak memiliki satu durasi universal untuk semua organisme.`}:                                `Sudden changes in temperature or salinity can cause stress. Receiving organisms from another site requires an acclimation procedure suited to the species, size, and transport system. Do not pour all transport water into the culture unit without following biosecurity procedures. Check the container, arrival time, environmental data, and lot status. If mortality or distress is present, stop any unsafe transfer and ask for direction. There is no single acclimation duration that applies to every organism.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Pukat cincin mengurung kelompok ikan dan menutup bagian bawah dengan sistem tali sesuai rancangan alat. Operasi melibatkan gerakan kapal, jaring, tali, serta alat bantu yang harus dikoordinasikan. Awak tidak mengubah posisi atau menginjak jaring demi mempercepat proses. Pastikan sinyal dan jalur penarikan diketahui. Beban serta gerakan ikan dapat berubah cepat, sehingga pemeriksaan posisi aman terus dilakukan. Keputusan mengejar kelompok atau menghentikan operasi menjadi kewenangan nakhoda sesuai keadaan.`}:                                   `A purse seine encircles a school of fish and closes below using a rope system designed for the gear. The operation involves coordinated vessel movement, nets, ropes, and auxiliary equipment. Crew members must not change position or step on the net to speed things up. Make sure signals and hauling routes are understood. Loads and fish movement can change quickly, so continue checking safe positions. The captain decides whether to pursue a school or stop operations according to conditions.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Rawai menggunakan tali utama, cabang, serta banyak kail; pancing lain memiliki rancangan dan cara operasi berbeda. Kail tajam dan tali bergerak menimbulkan risiko tertusuk serta terseret. Umpan disiapkan dengan alat, posisi, dan higiene yang sesuai. Jangan memegang kail atau ikan berbahaya tanpa metode yang diajarkan. Penebaran serta penarikan mengikuti komando, dengan jalur bebas kaki dan pakaian. Cedera kail dilaporkan dan ditangani sesuai pertolongan yang diajarkan, bukan ditarik paksa tanpa penilaian.`}:                                   `Longlines use a main line, branch lines, and many hooks; other fishing lines have different designs and operating methods. Sharp hooks and moving line create risks of puncture and entanglement. Prepare bait using suitable tools, positioning, and hygiene. Do not handle hooks or hazardous fish except with trained methods. Set and haul on command, keeping line clear of feet and clothing. Report hook injuries and provide the taught first aid; do not forcefully pull a hook out without assessment.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Respons orang jatuh ke laut harus mengikuti latihan kapal: beri alarm, sampaikan lokasi, pertahankan pengamatan bila aman, dan jalankan tugas yang ditetapkan. Jangan spontan melompat karena dapat menambah korban dan menghilangkan pengamat. Alat bantu dilempar atau dioperasikan hanya menurut prosedur dan posisi aman. Komunikasi harus singkat serta jelas; ulangi instruksi penting. Kenali titik berkumpul dan cara melaporkan orang hilang. Penyelamatan langsung memerlukan kendali nakhoda serta petugas terlatih.`}:                                  `Respond to a person overboard according to vessel drills: raise the alarm, report the location, maintain visual contact if safe, and carry out your assigned role. Do not jump in spontaneously, which could create another casualty and leave no observer. Throw or operate rescue equipment only under procedure and from a safe position. Keep communications brief and clear; repeat important instructions. Know the assembly point and how to report a missing person. Direct rescue requires the captain's control and trained personnel.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Rumput laut tumbuh dengan kondisi cahaya, suhu, salinitas, arus, dan unsur lingkungan yang sesuai spesies. Budidaya tanpa pakan tetap memerlukan penyiapan benih, pemasangan, pengaturan kepadatan, serta pemeriksaan tali dan organisme penempel. Penempatan terlalu padat dapat memengaruhi cahaya dan aliran, tetapi koreksi mengikuti rencana, bukan satu angka universal. Perubahan warna atau jaringan rusak dicatat dan dilaporkan. Panen serta pengeringan atau penyimpanan disesuaikan produk, dengan pencegahan pencemaran dari alat dan tempat kerja.`}: `Seaweed grows under light, temperature, salinity, current, and other environmental conditions suited to the species. Unfed aquaculture still requires stock preparation and deployment, density management, and checks of lines and fouling organisms. Excessive density may affect light and water flow, but adjustments follow the plan rather than one universal number. Record and report color changes or tissue damage. Adapt harvesting, drying, or storage to the product and prevent contamination from equipment and the work area.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Sortasi memisahkan hasil menurut jenis, mutu, ukuran, dan tujuan produk sesuai ketentuan. Timbang dengan alat yang diperiksa serta bedakan berat wadah dan hasil. Identitas lot menghubungkan kapal, waktu, area, serta perlakuan penanganan yang diperlukan. Jangan mencampur lot meragukan atau mengganti tanggal agar lolos standar. Catat hasil samping dan kerusakan secara faktual. Informasi yang benar memudahkan penelusuran bila ada keluhan atau penahanan produk, dan membantu serah terima ke petugas darat.`}:                                        `Sort products by species, quality, size, and destination according to requirements. Weigh them using checked equipment and distinguish container weight from product weight. Lot identification links the vessel, time, area, and required handling. Do not mix questionable lots or change dates to meet a standard. Record bycatch and damage factually. Accurate information makes tracing easier if there is a complaint or product hold and supports handover to shore staff.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Suhu, oksigen terlarut, pH, salinitas, serta parameter limbah dipantau sesuai spesies dan sistem. Satu nilai tidak menjelaskan seluruh kondisi. Alat ukur harus diperiksa atau dikalibrasi sesuai manual, lokasi dan waktu sampel dicatat agar hasil dapat dibandingkan. Ikan berkumpul di permukaan atau perubahan konsumsi dapat mengisyaratkan gangguan, tetapi diagnosis memerlukan data. Target oksigen dan tindakan koreksi mengikuti rencana fasilitas, bukan angka universal; jangan menambah bahan kimia berdasarkan tebakan.`}:                           `Monitor temperature, dissolved oxygen, pH, salinity, and waste parameters according to the species and system. A single reading does not describe the whole condition. Check or calibrate measuring equipment according to its manual, and record the sample location and time so results can be compared. Fish gathering at the surface or changes in consumption may signal a problem, but diagnosis requires data. Oxygen targets and corrective actions follow the facility plan, not a universal number; do not add chemicals based on a guess.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Tali dapat bergerak tiba-tiba, menjerat kaki, atau mencambuk ketika bertegangan dan putus. Kenali gulungan, lingkaran tali, arah tarikan, serta zona larangan. Jangan berdiri dalam lingkaran tali atau di jalur tali tegang. Simpul dipilih sesuai tugas dan dilatih dengan alat aman sebelum digunakan dalam operasi. Tali aus, terpotong, atau tidak sesuai kapasitas dilaporkan. Penyimpanan teratur membantu mencegah tersandung serta salah penggunaan; jangan menganggap semua simpul aman untuk semua beban.`}:                                             `Ropes can move suddenly, trap a foot, or whip when tensioned or broken. Identify coils, rope loops, the direction of pull, and restricted zones. Never stand inside a rope loop or in the path of a tensioned line. Choose knots for the task and practice them with safe equipment before using them in operations. Report ropes that are worn, cut, or unsuitable for the load. Organized storage helps prevent trips and misuse; do not assume every knot is safe for every load.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Trawl menarik jaring melalui air sesuai rancangan alat dan ketentuan operasi. Kabel, papan pembuka, jaring, serta kantong hasil memiliki risiko beban, ayunan, dan titik jepit. Jangan berdiri pada jalur atau di bawah alat tergantung. Pemeriksaan alat, kapasitas, dan sinyal dilakukan sebelum penanganan. Spesifikasi dasar, daerah, serta metode tangkap tidak diubah tanpa persetujuan. Hasil dan alat diperiksa setelah diangkat, dengan perhatian pada ikan berbahaya atau benda asing yang mungkin masuk.`}:                                              `A trawl tows a net through the water according to the gear design and operating rules. Cables, otter boards, nets, and catch bags present risks from loads, swinging gear, and pinch points. Do not stand in the line of movement or beneath suspended equipment. Check gear, capacity, and signals before handling. Do not change basic specifications, operating areas, or fishing methods without approval. After hauling, inspect the catch and equipment, watching for hazardous fish or foreign objects.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Winch serta roller memiliki bagian bergerak yang dapat menarik pakaian, sarung tangan, dan tubuh. Pengaman serta tombol berhenti darurat tidak menggantikan posisi kerja yang aman dan pelatihan. Perintah mulai harus dipahami semua awak yang terkait. Jangan menyentuh sumbatan atau memperbaiki alat saat energi belum diisolasi sesuai prosedur. Muatan dan alat angkat harus sesuai kapasitas. Beban tergantung tidak dilintasi atau dijadikan tempat berdiri. Kelainan bunyi, gerakan, atau kebocoran perlu dihentikan dan dilaporkan.`}:                    `Winches and rollers have moving parts that can catch clothing, gloves, or a person's body. Guards and emergency-stop buttons do not replace safe positioning and training. Everyone involved must understand the start command. Do not touch a blockage or repair equipment until its energy is isolated under procedure. Loads and lifting equipment must stay within capacity. Do not walk beneath a suspended load or stand on it. Stop and report unusual noise, movement, or leaks.`,
}
